nd performance"],[770,"**Deduplication**: Icon path data only exists once in the sprite sheet, regardless of how many times it's used"],[1870,"**Design system alignment**: 8px border radius, 12px bar width (1.5 GU), consistent spacing"],[772,"**DOM Output:**"],[1779,"**End**"],[717,"**Events**: `onClick`, `onMouseOver`, `onFocus`, etc."],[1674,"**Every part names its role with a slot**: `eyebrow`, `title`, `body`. Unslotted text follows\nthe lockup's tier too: a bare `Heading` takes the title tier and a bare `Text` the body tier."],[788,"**Fallback content**: Provide placeholder content for loading states"],[776,"**Faster Rendering**: Browser optimizations for `<use>` elements"],[761,"**First Request**: When an icon is first encountered, it triggers an asynchronous fetch from the CDN"],[710,"**Flexible sizing**: Support for `width` and `height` props"],[1334,"**Form integration**: Set `name` and the value submits as part of a native `<form>` (multiple values submit as repeated entries)"],[764,"**Full SVG Rendering**: Each icon instance renders as a complete SVG element with all path data"],[1893,"**Group gap**: Minimum 24px between bar groups"],[1905,"**Grouped rendering**: Bars are rendered in SVG `<Group>` elements for logical organization"],[1777,"**Home**"],[1908,"**Horizontal charts**: Vertical scrolling when many categories exceed container height"],[1897,"**Horizontal scrolling**: When data points exceed available width, the chart becomes horizontally scrollable"],[2087,"**HTML Elements:** When using `as=\"button\"`, TypeScript enforces button-specific props like `type`, `disabled`, and `onClick`."],[2078,"**Important**: Since `Flex` and `Grid` extend `Box`, prefer them for layouts. Use `Box` only when you need a non-flex, non-grid container."],[739,"**Important**: When you supply a `className`, you make a commitment to take over all styling of the component as it will remove the standard class names. Use data attributes for targeted styling instead."],[779,"